{"version":1,"content":"<p>有用開Threads的人都知道，很多人會在這個平台發貼，尋求各式各樣的意見，因工作關係，故常留意那些分享裝修、執屋，甚至尋找收納師的貼文。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;曾經好幾次，看到有人說準備搬新居，卻為添置家具而煩惱，例如：客廳實在很細，應該放</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:19.583178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:17.447058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:17.447058+00:00","content_hash":"2ec32edea10496b44a948638f429b19a0efd941f87f959407da7656dfe4fb213","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}